  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nuku&apos;alofa Urban Development Sector Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will support the establishment of municipal government in Nuku&apos;alofa and will provide high priority urban infrastructure identified in the Nuku&apos;alofa Urban Infrastructure Development Plan (UIDP).  The Project will expand upon infrastructure development currently being undertaken in Nuku&apos;alofa through the Nuku&apos;alofa Reconstruction Project (NRP) and the Integrated Urban Development Sector Project (IUDSP).</narrative>
  </description>
